  "description": "Coming from a big agency, an idol trainee for 7 years, Lee Dojoon, who suppose to debut as a leader in a new group had a big accident which happened during a music video shoot. After the incident, his debut got cancelled, and has been inactive for half a year.\n\nThen suddenly, a miracle happened when he open his eyes...\n\n[Collect 'likes' in SNS and get an item!]  \n[Remaining time: 167:59:59]\n\nWhy am I suddenly hallucinating.\n\nIt's not like this is a webnovel, so why am I suddenly seeing a status window?  \nIf that happen then it would be better to go back to when my debut got cancelled.\n\n[00:00:00]  \n[Time's up.]\n\nThen, an ominous bright sentence appeared in front of him.\n\n[The system is shutting down.]\n\nIf you want to live, receive 'likes'!  \nHopeful to become an idol, Dojoon is entering the entertainment business anxiously!",
